mode: "100644"
text: "# Scope, distinctions + connections\n\nlivestream-and-realtime plans, promotes, runs, and repurposes **live/realtime moments.** The agent **plans the\nlive + schedules the promo + advises the live playbook + plans the repurpose**; **WoopSocial schedules the\npromo + publishes the repurposed clips**; **the broadcast + realtime engagement + live shopping are native/\nhuman.**\n\n## Honest scope (never violate)\n- **The agent** plans the **format/platform + run-of-show**, **writes + schedules the pre-live promo**,\n  **advises the live-engagement playbook** (the human runs the broadcast), and **plans the repurposing.**\n- **WoopSocial** schedules the **promo posts** + publishes the **repurposed clips/replay.** It does **NOT**\n  broadcast/run the live (native — IG/TikTok/YouTube/LinkedIn/X), do **realtime comments/moderation**, or run\n  **live shopping.**\n- The **live broadcast + realtime engagement + live shopping** are **native/human.** **Never fabricate viewer\n  numbers; never buy fake live views.** **Promote-before + repurpose-after is where WoopSocial adds value.**\n  **Verify-quarterly** (thresholds/features).\n\n## Distinct from its siblings\n- **livestream-and-realtime (this)** — the **live-event format** (plan → promote → run → repurpose).\n- **community-management** — **ongoing community** engagement, incl. **native live moderation** (this is the\n  live *event*; in-the-moment moderation during it is community-management/native).\n- **engagement-routine** — the **daily** engagement cadence (this is a live event).\n- **campaign-and-launch-planning** — the **multi-post launch arc** (a live can be a **beat** in it).\n- **captions-and-clipping** — the **clip craft/tool** (the repurposing **routes the recording there**).\n- **content-recycling / cross-platform-repurposing** — the **reuse axes** (the recording is a **source**).\n- **social-selling-and-dm / lead-magnets-and-funnels** — the **keyword-to-DM capture** during the live routes\n  there.\n- **reels-script / tiktok-script** — **scripted** short video (live is realtime/unscripted — a loose\n  run-of-show, not a script).\n\n## Where this connects\n- **Reads first:** `brand-profile` (voice/goal), the **live's goal + audience.**\n- **Promo + repurpose via:** `scheduling-and-queue → WoopSocial` (schedule the promo; publish the clips).\n- **Repurposing routes to:** `captions-and-clipping` (clips), `content-recycling` /\n  `cross-platform-repurposing` (replay + reuse), `youtube-publishing-and-metadata` (the replay as a video).\n- **Capture routes to:** `social-selling-and-dm` / `lead-magnets-and-funnels` (keyword-to-DM intent).\n- **Native moderation during the live:** `community-management`. **A live as a launch beat:**\n  `campaign-and-launch-planning`. **Measure with:** native live analytics + `analytics-and-reporting` (never\n  fabricated).\n"
